<title>USA: TABLE - Granite Q2 oper shr runs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Granite Q2 oper shr runs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr loss	     $0.42   profit	 $0.10</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,169   profit	 2,428</p>
<p> Net revs		  41,332		   33,961</p>
<p> Oper profit	     13,508   profit	11,856</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,764		    9,184</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net shr loss	     $1.47     loss	 $0.40</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,082     loss	 4,536</p>
<p> Net rev		   73,630		   62,591</p>
<p> Oper profit	     19,646		   17,963</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,750		    8,545</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Granite Broadcasting Corp.</p>
<p>Part of the increase ($5.6 million) in net revenue for Q2 1997 was due to the inclusion of three months of operations of WXON-TV and WLAJ-TV.</p>
<p>Part of the increase ($9.1 million) in net revenue for the six-month period in 1997 was due to the inclusion of five months of operations of WXON-TV and six months of operations of WLAJ-TV.</p>
<p>1996 Q2 net shr profit excludes extraordinary gain of $0.07.</p>
<p>1997 six-month net shr loss excludes $0.04 extraordinary loss, while 1996 six-month net shr loss excludes $0.34 extraordinary loss.</p>
</text>
